/* App keys. English fallback literals; preserve all format arguments. */
"%@\n\n%@\n\nThe local source document is not a system Hosts backup. Restore uses only the helper's verified baseline, never an app-selected path." = "%@\n\n%@\n\n本地规则源文档不是系统 Hosts 备份。恢复仅使用辅助程序核验过的基线，不接受 App 选择的任意路径。";
"%@\n\nRequired: native RootHide, LetMeBlock 1.3.0-1+native1, libSandy 1.1.6-4, CCSupport. Installed versions are not verified here.\n\nFixed managed entry: jbroot('/etc/hosts'). RootHide may mirror this as a symlink. Only the helper may replace the entry after validation; this app never writes system Hosts.\n\nLocal sources: this app's Application Support/QuietHosts. Source URLs are private local refresh metadata. No arbitrary path operations are available." = "%@\n\n所需依赖：原生 RootHide、LetMeBlock 1.3.0-1+native1、libSandy 1.1.6-4、CCSupport。此处未核验实际安装版本。\n\n固定托管入口：jbroot('/etc/hosts')。RootHide 可能以符号链接镜像此入口；仅辅助程序可在校验后替换目录项，App 不直接写入系统 Hosts。\n\n本地规则源：本 App 的 Application Support/QuietHosts。来源链接仅作为私有的手动更新元数据保存。不提供任意路径操作。";
"%@\n\nThe entire refresh was discarded. Every saved snapshot is unchanged." = "%@\n\n本次整批更新已放弃，所有已保存快照均保持不变。";
"%@ exceptions. Only exact domains are excluded from our generated blocklist; no wildcard, suffix, or URL rules." = "%@ 条例外。仅从我们生成的屏蔽项中排除完整域名，不支持通配符、后缀或 URL 规则。";
