"This basic Hosts file needs a separate backup-and-adopt confirmation. No takeover was authorized by this request. Check file state and review the first-apply preview." = "这份基础 Hosts 需要单独确认“备份并接管”。本次请求未授权接管，请检查文件状态并查看首次应用预览。";
"The paired RootHide data directory or its linking relationship could not be verified. Keep both roots and links unchanged; report this diagnostic code instead of changing their permissions." = "无法核验配对的 RootHide 数据目录或链接关系。请保持两个根目录和链接不变，反馈诊断码，不要修改它们的权限。";
"Back up and adopt basic Hosts" = "备份并接管基础 Hosts";
"You are authorizing QuietHosts to take over the existing basic Hosts file. The helper will preserve its exact contents and permissions before applying this draft. Disable restores that saved file. If the file or directory mapping changes after this preview, the operation is refused. No directory ownership or links will be repaired automatically." = "你将授权静域接管已有的基础 Hosts 文件。辅助程序会先保存它的完整内容和权限，再应用此草稿；关闭时恢复所保存的文件。如果预览后文件或目录映射变化，操作会被拒绝。此操作不会自动修改目录属主或修补链接。";
"Confirm backup and Apply" = "确认备份并应用";
